# No owl:Ontology (#484). The first @prefix holds no class, and most classes are in m:,
# so the shape namespace is http://example.org/m-shapes# whatever the prefix order.
@prefix z: <http://example.org/z#> .
@prefix a: <http://example.org/a#> .
@prefix m: <http://example.org/m#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

z:thing a owl:Thing .
a:Lone a owl:Class .
m:Cat a owl:Class .
m:Dog a owl:Class .
